@startuml forms-vol10-flow
title Sample flow - forensic medical examination (volume 10)
autonumber

participant "Law\nenforcement" as LE
participant "Forensic\nbureau (vol 10)" as FB
participant "Forensic\nlabs" as LAB

LE -> FB : case referred (body or living person)
alt deceased
  FB -> FB : 233 thanatology registration\n229 examination report
else living person
  FB -> FB : 234 outpatient registration\n242 narcological examination
end
FB -> LAB : 231 referral to forensic lab
LAB -> LAB : 232 histology, 236/237 biology,\n241 chemistry, 245 criminalistics
LAB -> FB : results
FB -> LE : 230 expert conclusion

note over FB, LAB
  A distinct legal domain. Lab steps share the
  DiagnosticReport pattern, but the volume as a
  whole is out of clinical-integration scope.
end note
@enduml
